= Discussion <sec:discussion>
The algorithms we looked at involved a lot of sense-making,
especially when shoe-horning tree generation into them @sense_making.
This is apparently a hot topic for modern systems and black-boxes,
and rightfully so. Emergent behavior from small cells that interact is 
what nature is all about, and this research was a pleasant reminder of that.
Getting steered into a stochastic process was englightening,
as someone often too focused on the reductionism that occurs in engineering. 

